WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:05.730
<b>Women's Bath</b>

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.530
I'm a journalist, Osono!

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.730
I'm going undercover for a scoop!

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:09.050
My target is the Edo Women's Bath.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.940
Here I go!

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.660
I'm a journalist, Osono.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:35.440
<b>Journalist</b>

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.780
I'm a newspaper reporter,

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.070
and my job is to share the hottest news.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.700
<b>Top Secret</b>

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:44.820
Lately I've been chasing a scoop 
on the Insect Magistrates

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.710
who protect Edo from insects.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.370
Especially Tsukishima Jinbei-san!

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.210
<b>Tsukishima Jinbei</b>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.750
But today, he's gone out to train...

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:02.070
So I'm going to ask someone else.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.370
I've come to this women's bath,

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:07.600
where people close to the Insect 
Magistrate's Office like to bathe.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:10.890
I'm Osono-chan, ace reporter,

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:14.230
and I'm going to get my scoop!

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:19.240
<b>We'll Show You Everything!! 
The Edo Women's Baths!!</b>

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:24.150
In a bath, you relax and 
lower your guard, right?

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.560
Today, I'll find out all there is to know

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.300
about a scoop that will surprise everyone!

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.330
I'm a genius!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.520
Now, where should I start?

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.750
Look at those peaches!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.390
I feel so small...

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.260
U-Um, excuse me...

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.770
Eh? What is it?

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.810
Don't stare at them...

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:57.540
S-Sorry!

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.650
Anyway, I'm the journalist Osono.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.260
Aren't you Oharu-chan, of the tea shop?

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.660
Y-Yes...

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.980
There's my first scoop.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.040
Eat dumplings daily at the tea shop,

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.510
and your peaches will grow really large!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.100
It isn't due to the dumplings!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.170
Probably...

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.930
I'm trying to find out more 
on the Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:24.430
I heard you've known Tsukishima Jinbei-san 
since his arrival in Edo!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.440
Y-Yes...

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.880
I've known him since he arrived from Tsugaru.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:34.450
Excuse me...

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:35.310
Yes?

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.650
Are you hurt?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.660
Thank you so much!

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.750
So sweet! So kind...

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.270
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:55.450
I'm Jinbei, and I've come here to work

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.290
at the Insect Magistrate's Office!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.060
My, the Insect Magistrate's?

00:03:59.060 --> 00:03:59.550
Yes.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:03.170
My name is Haru.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.680
I work here, at this tea shop.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.900
<i>Wow!</i>

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.200
Is something wrong?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.920
No, nothing.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.850
Thanks for showing me the way, too.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:17.870
It's fine.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.110
What made you decide to join 
the Insect Magistrate's Office?

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:26.950
My father, in Tsugaru, was actually summoned.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.950
However, my father

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.950
cannot travel.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:41.960
So I asked to fulfill my father's duties in his stead.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.720
It took one of the girls!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.520
Oharu-chan, from the tea stand!

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.640
Oharu-dono?

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:49.730
Where did it go?

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:50.670
That way!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:53.980
<i>Oharu-dono...</i>

00:04:55.100 --> 00:05:00.610
<i>So others wouldn't be attacked, 
as my parents were.</i>

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.620
<i>No!</i>

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.370
<i>It's quite common here, in Edo.</i>

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:26.090
I'm sorry it took me so long to get here!

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.270
Jinbei-sama!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.460
<i>It's time.</i>

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.020
<i>This is my first fight in Edo.</i>

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.600
My name is Tsukishima Jinbei!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.820
Here I come!

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:46.950
<i>Stay calm!</i>

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:53.370
<i>Always be ready for a fight!</i>

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.360
<b>Always be ready for a fight.</b>

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:12.990
No!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.600
Father!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.560
Mother!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.560
Save me!

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:29.450
Please don't worry, Oharu-dono...

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:36.350
I will not allow these monsters to touch you!

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.230
I'll be stronger than anyone.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.700
Even stronger than my father!

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.610
Keep winning until you die!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.850
Always be ready for a fight!

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.330
What a great story...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.040
Thanks, Oharu-chan!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.200
Not at all.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.470
Goodbye, then.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.040
This is going really well!

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.980
That's Hibachi-san, 
of the Insect Magistrate's Office!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.630
She's so gorgeous...

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.280
I feel so small again.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.650
You, there...

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.030
Stop staring.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.230
I couldn't help myself.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.120
You're just so cool and gorgeous, Hibachi-san.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.550
Am I?

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.100
I don't know if anyone's ever 
told me that before...

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:52.300
Hibachi-san, I'm a journalist.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.410
Can you tell me about the Insect Magistrate's Office?

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.930
About the Magistrate's Office?

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.160
Let's see...

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:05.080
Right, since everyone's here, let's start by

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.310
explaining to Jinbei-kun our work here.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:07.920
Please!

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:14.960
Japan is filled with giant 
insects that eat humans.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.200
They first appeared about a century ago.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:22.240
Why are they here?

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.350
How did it happen?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.320
Where did they come from?

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.360
We are still investigating.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.940
And ten years ago,

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:35.950
the Shinnakamachi Magistrate, 
or the Insect Magistrate's Office,

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:39.120
was created to protect Edo from them.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:43.630
We work for the Insect Magistrate, 
fighting insects every day.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:48.030
And where is the Insect Magistrate?

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:50.380
I'd like to meet him!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.670
That's unnecessary.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:57.680
The Insect Magistrate does not 
reveal himself to others.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.950
No way a new kid could meet him.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.310
Even we've never met him.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:05.720
Really?

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.560
Do you understand now, Jinbei-kun?

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:12.570
The peace of Edo rests on your shoulders.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:21.240
<i>Those are the finest words a 
Samurai could hope to hear!</i>

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:28.580
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall fulfill the duty 
appointed to me by the Shogunate!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.400
And the man I admire more than anyone,

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.760
Mugai-san, works for the Insect Magistrate!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:49.810
Mugai-dono's overwhelming strength 
makes those behind him feel safe!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:55.850
Then and there, I decided that 
I would make him my goal.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.860
That's the kind of guy he is, right?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:01.370
He makes you think you want to be like him.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:02.870
Right!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.990
He's cool, isn't he?

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:04.480
Yes.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.120
He's wonderful, isn't he?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:05.570
Yes.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.590
He's the best, isn't he?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.160
Yes.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:12.040
Wait, why am I discussing 
Mugai-san with you, anyway?!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.610
Right, right!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:17.690
Then what's the Insect Magistrate like?

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.440
I can't tell you that.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:23.450
We only just met, not too long ago.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.510
So you have met them!

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:26.860
I guess so.

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:31.190
I never expected we'd meet under 
those circumstances, though.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:32.660
Huh?

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.380
You ever hear of the Insect Hunters?

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.370
They're a wandering group of mercenaries 
that you can hire to fight insects.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:42.290
They attacked the Magistrate.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.240
Let's go, men...

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.160
It's time for revenge!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:23.320
It appears we have intruders on this island.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.350
I'm sorry to all the creatures
 that live on Hachijo Island.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:39.470
Wait.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:42.080
What is it, leader?

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.600
Are you scared?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.470
The insects stopped chirping.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.980
The insects...

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.400
Poison fog.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.150
Seriously?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.680
Everyone, drink your antidotes.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.850
Let's go.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:10.280
The Insect Magistrate is within 
 this poison fog.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.310
Tsukishima, what are you grabbing?

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.800
Let go of me.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.840
I can't...

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.440
I'll die!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.910
What?

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.430
What is that fog?

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.100
I don't know.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:29.770
Stay sharp.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.430
We're the first ones here.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.560
Hibachi-dono, leave it to me!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.700
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall do everything

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:41.190
in my power to not slow you down!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:44.110
Where are your hands?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.000
Those are the Insect Hunters?

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:02.340
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms.</i>

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.810
I won't stand here and let you attack me.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:18.190
She blocked the explosions with 
the shock wave from her kicks?

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.790
This is the Insect Hunters' power,

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.190
stupid, weird-faced girl.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.070
W-Weird-faced?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.070
You're a flat-chested four-eyes!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.830
You shouldn't have said that.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.000
<i>Armor Kick!</i>

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.730
I don't think I can say more than that.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.010
Please?!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.680
Nope.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.170
I'm getting out.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.900
Please wait...

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.680
Nope.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:52.310
Please, please, please!

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:31.870
So much has happened since 
I went to Hachijo Island.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.310
You're in the way, insect.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:48.450
Tsukishima isn't one of you?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.490
What are you talking about?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.300
Stop moving around!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.750
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Counter!</i>

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.970
Run away while there's still time, Miss.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:20.580
And tell the Insect Magistrate that, together,

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.020
we can look at the sky in Edo!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.570
<i>He merely wished to protect me...</i>

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:34.100
I simply didn't want to hurt him...

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:40.540
He must have been so very warm.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.710
I hate myself for no longer being human!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:04.480
You will not leave this place alive.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:07.730
Show yourself for what you are, Kuroageha!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.250
Kuroageha...

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:34.050
I will take your puny souls...

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.880
and crush them into dust.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:41.110
Here it comes!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.440
Is that her power?

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.610
This monster is immortal.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.570
She was playing with us, 
like we were kittens.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.470
If you understand that much,

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.340
then prepare for your destruction.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.810
Kaina... Gaikotsu!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:03.270
Do it.

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.930
Evil Insect-Slaying Blade, Insect Hunter,

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:11.450
ready to fire.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.020
Fire, Kaina!

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.300
It's useless.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.680
No attack can touch me.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.980
Did you think that little trick 
would work on me?

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.240
<i>The front blade made it through intact?</i>

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.500
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.430
What's going on?

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.510
My power is fading...

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.650
The tiny red blade that pierced your chest

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:18.280
was the Evil Insect-Slaying Blade, Insect Hunter.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.110
Well, Insect Magistrate?

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:24.340
Could you feel our hate 
emanating from that blade?

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:33.800
It was thanks to you that I made 
it back, Tsukishima Jinbei.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.470
Yo...

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:59.200
You have such a pretty face.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.340
Be happy.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:05.110
I'm going to rip it apart.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.330
<i>Tsukishima!</i>

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:12.880
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.430
<i>I won't be able to keep my promise</i>

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.880
<i>to see the Edo skies with you!</i>

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.570
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:38.700
<i>Promise!</i>

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.310
M-Miss...

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.640
Are you okay?

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.600
T-Tsukishima?

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.330
Let's hurry to the Insect Magistrate!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.610
And also,

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.030
keep our promise...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.290
Tsukishima?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:41.340
<i>With my power gone, I can no longer 
protect Edo from the insects.</i>

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.810
<i>What am I able to do now?</i>

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.290
Okay, my draft's done...

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.860
I figured you'd still be here.

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:56.830
Wait, are you writing that here?

00:20:56.830 --> 00:21:00.180
Yeah, the research was just going so well.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:03.090
You need to get out, or you'll get sick.

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:04.780
Should we open a window?

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:12.290
What is this?!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.480
Wait...

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.430
You can't write this about me!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.060
Rip those up now!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.150
My papers...

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.660
Stop it!

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.990
Get back here!

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.200
Don't look!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:01.650
Edo's in big trouble!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.360
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:02.750
Someone's hurt!

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:04.940
Hibachi-dono, do you have anything 
to stop the bleeding?

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:05.860
No...

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:08.000
What about that white cloth you always wear?

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.610
If you take that, I won't have underwear!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:11.450
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:12.710
Insect? Man?

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Insect!? Man!? 
A Mysterious Enemy Attacks!</b>

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:14.000
A Mysterious Enemy Attacks.
